Fonts in VibeOS
===============

Inter-VF.ttf          Inter 4.001 (git-66647c0bb), variable (opsz 14-32, wght 100-900), https://github.com/rsms/inter
JetBrainsMono-VF.ttf  JetBrains Mono 2.211, variable (wght 100-800), https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
NotoSans-VF.ttf       Noto Sans (notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic), variable (wght, wdth); only for the legacy
                      font_ui / font_ui_bold / font_big cuts, delete it with them once every caller uses a T_* role
