Unmodified copies of the upstream release files (the same ones the redesign mockups were rendered with). They are
not used by the build: tools/mkfont.py instances them (opsz = size, wght per face, Inter's tnum digits; docs/DESIGN.md 3.1) and bakes
8-bit glyph tables into common/fonts.c and common/termfonts.c, which are committed. Re-run it after changing fonts.
